The '''Ovise Reach''' was a [[Hyperspace route|hyperlane]] in the [[Outer Rim Territories]] [[Moddell sector]] that passed between the [[Monsua Nebula]] and [[Din Nebula]]. It connected the [[planet]] [[Endor]] to [[Zorbia]] and then Zorbia to [[Trindello]] before carrying on toward the edge of the [[sector]]. Endor acted as a junction from the Ovise Reach onto the [[Sanctuary Pipeline]].<ref name="BMF18" />

==Behind the scenes==
The Ovise Reach was mentioned in the new ''[[Star Wars]]'' [[canon]] in the [[2015]] magazine [[Star Wars: Build the Millennium Falcon 18|''Star Wars: Build the Millennium Falcon'' 18]].<ref name="BMF18" /> It originated in the [[Star Wars Legends|''Star Wars'' Legends]] coninuity, where it was mentioned in the [[2009]] reference book ''[[The Essential Atlas]]'', which was written by [[Jason Fry]] and [[Daniel Wallace]].<ref name="TEA">''[[The Essential Atlas]]''</ref>

